# HeyGen Skills — API key for the CLI / direct-API transport.
# Get it from https://app.heygen.com/api (Settings -> API -> New Key).
# The key is shown once — copy it before closing the modal.
#
# NOTE: setting this short-circuits HeyGen MCP detection. If you want the
# skills to bill against your HeyGen *plan* credits via MCP, leave it unset.
HEYGEN_API_KEY=
